course: dictionary
lesson: 883
title: Biological: about living things
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: «Biological» is a word about living things: their bodies, how they grow, and how they work. Biology is the science that studies living things, so a biology lesson is about life.
explain: The word can also mean related by birth, not by adoption or marriage, as in a biological father. Context helps here. «People are biological intelligences: minds that grew in bodies, with families, food, sleep and feelings.» Bodies, food and sleep are all about living things, so biological means to do with life and bodies.
explain: The word is also used on packets. A washing powder can be called biological, which means it contains natural enzymes that break down dirt. Ask yourself what fits in the sentence, then swap your meaning in to check it still makes sense.
fact: Biological means to do with living things and how they grow and work.
fact: Biology is the study of living things, so the two words are linked.
fact: Biological parents are the parents you are related to by birth, not by adoption.
fact: «Biological washing powder» contains natural enzymes that break down dirt.
fact: Biologically is the adverb, and it means in a way that relates to living things or bodies.
exercise: «People are biological intelligences, with bodies that get tired, hungry, ill and old.» What does biological mean here? | Made of metal and plastic | To do with money and banks | To do with living bodies | *To do with living bodies, but I cannot be sure without reading on
exercise: What does «biological parents» mean? | Parents who live in a castle | Teachers who help at school | Parents who work in a laboratory | *Parents you are related to by birth
exercise: A box in the shop says «biological washing powder». What does biological tell you? | Makes clothes smell of flowers | It is cheap | *Contains natural enzymes that break down dirt | Stops clothes shrinking
test: Which word means to do with living things and how they work? | Mechanical | Magnetic | *Biological | Electrical
test: «People are biological intelligences, with bodies that get tired, hungry, ill and old, so you stay patient with their tiredness.» What do the clues tell you about biological? | Biological means about cars | Biological means about money | *Bodies, hunger and tiredness are about living things | Biological means about the weather
exam: Which best explains biological science? | Science about rocks and volcanoes | *Science about living things and how they grow and work | Science about computers and code | Science about stars and planets
